{{ img:units/Pylon.png|Pylon}}
=Pylon=
*  Health: 4
*  Price: %Minerals% 20
*  [[concepts/scanning range|Scanning range]]: 2
Pylons can establish wireless links between [[concepts/compound]]s that are too distant from one another to otherwise connect. Wirelessly connected pylons form [[concepts/compound]]s and share their input/output. They also provide an extended drawing range for terraformers to draw from.
